      "date": "2026-02-15T23:58:24.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.76 (vs ₹0.93 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.76 (up from ₹0.93 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹68.9b (up 18% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.35b (up 195% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.0% (up from 0.8% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 29% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 7% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
